&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance and the Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
