&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;A genuine interest in learning the practical, technical side of the business (APIs, encryption, LLMs, cloud architecture) well enough to give real-time guidance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
