&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anticipated Posting Close Date*: 12/21/26&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Job posting may close early due to the volume of applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Order-to-Cash Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Every deal we sign has to become an accurate order, an accurate invoice and accurate revenue, and this role makes that happen. As Director, Order-to-Cash Operations, you will lead Order Management, Billing and Revenue Operations at a growing, publicly traded SaaS company, reporting to the VP, Revenue Accounting. You will manage a Senior Manager, Billing and an Order Management Manager, hire and build a Revenue Operations Manager, and work closely with Deal Strategy, Finance and Sales Operations. You will also represent Order-to-Cash in Fastly’s company-wide Lead-to-Cash transformation and support Revenue Accounting on ASC 606 matters. This is a hands-on leadership role where you will see the impact of your work on every deal we close.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Lead the Order Management, Billing and Revenue Operations teams, including hiring and developing a new Revenue Operations Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Own the order-to-invoice process, from Deal Desk approval and Closed-Won through accurate, timely invoicing, with clear service levels for order and invoice accuracy, turnaround time and backlog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Define and own the source of truth for revenue data and metrics, and drive data governance for audit-ready compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Partner with Business Systems and IT to keep Salesforce, CPQ, billing and ERP processes scalable and less manual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Represent Order-to-Cash in Fastly’s company-wide Lead-to-Cash transformation, including process design and adoption&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Support Revenue Accounting on ASC 606 matters and deliver reporting and variance analysis to Finance and executive leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;10+ years of experience in Order Management, Billing, Revenue Operations or Order-to-Cash at a B2B SaaS company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;4+ years of experience leading teams, including managing managers or senior individual contributors, and building diverse and inclusive teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Hands-on understanding of Salesforce, CPQ, billing and ERP platforms, and how contract and order data moves between them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of ASC 606 and how contract terms affect billing and revenue recognition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and communication skills, with the ability to partner across Finance, Accounting, Sales Operations, Deal Desk, Legal and IT and explain complex process and data issues to executive leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in accounting, finance or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’ll be super impressed if you have experience in any of these:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;CPA designation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience leading a Lead-to-Cash, order-to-cash or similar process and systems transformation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with SOX controls and supporting external audits in a public company or late-stage environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience reviewing complex, non-standard contracts and identifying the terms that affect revenue recognition, billing and order setup&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Regular, hands-on use of AI tools such as Claude, ChatGPT and Gemini to improve operational workflows, with sound judgment on when AI output needs review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
