&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building a more trustworthy Internet. Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Operations Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;People Operations Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team on a &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6-month&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; temporary basis. This is a hands-on role for an experienced People Operations professional who can hit the ground running, independently own work, and help improve how our People team operates at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has experience supporting a &lt;strong&gt;global employee population&lt;/strong&gt;, strong systems and process expertise, and a continuous-improvement mindset. They will bring sound judgment, strong problem-solving skills, and an interest in leveraging &lt;strong&gt;AI and automation to create efficiencies, reduce manual work, and improve the People Team experience&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and support People Operations processes and initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; across an international organization, ensuring work is executed accurately, efficiently, and with appropriate attention to global requirements&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a &lt;strong&gt;first point of escalation for People Team questions&lt;/strong&gt;, independently troubleshooting moderately complex issues, resolving where possible, and partnering with subject matter experts when appropriate&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support &lt;strong&gt;testing and implementation of People systems, processes, and workflows&lt;/strong&gt;, including developing test cases, coordinating testing, documenting outcomes, identifying issues, and tracking resolution&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and continuously improve &lt;strong&gt;People Operations documentation, workflows, and SOPs&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring processes are clear, scalable, and easy for the team to follow&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and optimize workflows across &lt;strong&gt;Workday, Jira, and other People systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to leverage &lt;strong&gt;AI, automation, and emerging technologies&lt;/strong&gt; to improve operational efficiency, reduce repetitive work, improve data and process quality, and enhance the People Team experience&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders to identify process gaps, assess solutions, and implement improvements that create a more consistent and scalable global People Operations experience&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support &lt;strong&gt;global People compliance&lt;/strong&gt; efforts by helping ensure processes are appropriately documented, consistently executed, and aligned with applicable requirements&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data, process insights, and operational feedback to identify trends and recommend improvements&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
