&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing a formal partner/channel program or quota attached to partner-influenced revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selling security technologies, content delivery network services, or website performance specifically through channel partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Large, complex organizations with many business units.&lt;/li&gt;
