&lt;h4&gt;AI Statement&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure a fair and equitable interview process for everyone, the use of AI technologies—including real-time transcription tools, automated scripts, AI copilots, or external assistants—is strictly prohibited during the interview process unless explicitly authorized by the company in advance. Unauthorized use of AI tools may result in disqualification.&lt;/p&gt;
