&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Senior Engineering Manager - Edge Delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Fastly is hiring a Senior Engineering Manager to lead our Edge Delivery team. This team owns the customized Varnish engine at the core of Fastly’s global platform, operating at the intersection of complex systems software engineering and edge infrastructure. They build and operate the engine, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;VCL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; compiler, and edge caching systems that power Fastly worldwide, tackling major platform initiatives like next-generation split storage architectures, VCL language evolution and origin connectivity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside an engineering director who focuses on strategy and executive alignment, leaving you free to manage 15 senior engineers, establish effective team structures, and support steady project execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Manage a distributed team working on Varnish internals and developing new VCL features.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Organize the team into sustainable structures to ensure effective and scalable team operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Focus on direct management: run regular 1:1s, provide feedback, support career growth, and help retain top technical talent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Partner with product managers and your director to break high-level roadmaps into clear engineering projects, protecting engineers from unnecessary churn.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Unblock technical issues, refine daily workflows, and maintain high standards for platform uptime and performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Participate in incident response: help triage outages, ask the right technical questions, and support the team under pressure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the team focused on core software performance metrics: high-throughput efficiency, memory safety in C/Rust, and system stability under massive load.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience managing infrastructure or systems engineering teams, including experience leading larger groups (10+ engineers) or setting up tech lead structures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;10+ years of related engineering experience in low-latency systems, infrastructure software, CDNs, or C/C++/Rust environments, with enough depth to review engineering proposals and prioritize tech debt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Enthusiasm for developing senior engineers, building balanced team workflows, and measuring success by team output and health.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Experience building collaborative, accountable teams with a habit of providing clear, honest, and constructive feedback.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with experience managing distributed teams and turning complex goals into clear tasks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;A practical approach to problem-solving and a preference for automation over manual work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;We’ll be super impressed if you have experience in any of these:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Varnish or high-throughput HTTP proxy architectures (e.g., Envoy, Nginx, Apache Traffic Server).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #292a2e;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of HTTP caching mechanics and protocols (headers, stale-while-revalidate, conditional requests, object lifecycles).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to the software challenges of CDNs, globally distributed edge networks or large-scale traffic management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
