&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Job posting may close early due to the volume of applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Executive Assistant to the CLAO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The Senior Executive Assistant is a trusted partner to Fastly&#39;s Chief Legal and Administrative Officer, a member of our Executive Leadership Team. The CLAO leads Fastly’s Legal organization, its Information Security organization, led by Fastly’s CISO, and Fastly’s Sustainability function, so this role supports a broad and highly sensitive scope. This role is ideal for an experienced Executive Assistant who has supported senior leaders, thrives on precision, and is ready to be deeply embedded in a high-stakes, confidential environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;You will be the CLAO&#39;s primary resource managing a demanding calendar and travel, safeguarding sensitive information, and keeping the details right every time. You will also grow beyond traditional administrative work by learning the Legal, InfoSec, and Sustainability functions, anticipating needs, and improving how work gets done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Fastly, we hire administrative professionals who are reliable, highly organized, and proactive problem solvers. They are self-starters driven by curiosity, always looking for ways to improve how work gets done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Manage a complex, high-volume executive calendar, aligning priorities with business and legal objectives across time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Plan and coordinate domestic and international travel end to end, including itineraries, visas where needed, and rapid changes of plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Prepare agendas, briefing materials, presentations, and executive communications with meticulous accuracy, including for staff and team meetings and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Manage expense reporting accurately and on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Capture meeting notes, track action items, and drive follow-through across stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Anticipate conflicts, risks, and needs before they surface.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Partner with the CLAO on Board related matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confidentiality and Discretion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Handle privileged, confidential and highly sensitive information with absolute discretion. That includes board, M&amp;amp;A, litigation and investigation matters, plus security incidents and vulnerabilities from the Information Security organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Treat confidentiality as a work priority. Be someone the CLAO can trust with full transparency, including sensitive calendar details, personal and professional.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Follow secure practices for document handling, sharing and access, and respect privilege and confidentiality markings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Act as a trusted gatekeeper. Use sound judgment on access, prioritization and escalation, and surface anything involving the Board or ELT quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Build a strong understanding of the Legal, Information Security, and Sustainability organizations, their priorities and their operating rhythms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Coordinate communication between the CLAO, the CISO, the Legal and Security leadership teams, the ELT, the Board, and outside counsel and other external partners. Prioritize work with a sensitivity towards executive engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Manage a high-volume calendar with consistent conventions. That means travel buffers, a conference room and Zoom on every invite, and a clear invite format. Also manage the CLAO’s external board commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Support planning and execution of leadership meetings, offsites, and Legal and Security team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Identify and implement improvements to workflows, tools and administrative processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Help build team connection, communication workflows, and knowledge resources.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Administrative Community&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Executive Assistants and Administrative Business Partners across Fastly for seamless coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Share best practices that strengthen the broader administrative community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Contribute to a collaborative, team-first culture within the administrative organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for an Executive Assistant with a track record of supporting senior leaders, exceptional attention to detail, and impeccable judgment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ideal candidate will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Be meticulous and detail-oriented, catching what others miss and striving for error-free work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Demonstrate exceptional discretion and integrity with confidential information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Be proactive, accountable, and a critical thinker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Build trusted relationships at every level of the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Communicate clearly and professionally with executives, employees, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Take initiative, solving problems before they become obstacles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Thrive managing multiple competing priorities in a fast-paced, global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Adapt quickly while staying focused on what matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Use modern workplace technologies and AI tools to improve efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition, the ideal candidate will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience supporting senior executives in a fast-paced technology or high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience supporting Senior Vice Presidents, C-level, or Executive Leadership Team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience coordinating complex domestic and international travel and high-volume calendars.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience supporting a Legal, Compliance, CISO Org or Board-facing function (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience with working across multiple time zones and global teams (and a degree of flexibility to support this need as it arises).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency with Google Workspace, Slack, Coupa, and modern workplace technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience using AI-powered productivity tools to streamline administrative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent professional experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Hours:&lt;/strong&gt; This position requires working scheduled business hours aligned to the needs of the role in our San Francisco Office. The role also requires working with stakeholders across multiple time zones, with strong asynchronous work habits.&lt;/p&gt;
