&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fastly helps people stay better connected with the things they love. Fastly’s edge cloud platform enables customers to create great digital experiences quickly, securely, and reliably by processing, serving, and securing our customers’ applications as close to their end-users as possible — at the edge of the Internet. The platform is designed to take advantage of the modern internet, to be programmable, and to support agile software development. Fastly’s customers include many of the world’s most prominent companies, including GitHub, Yelp, Paramount, and JetBlue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building a more trustworthy Internet. Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posting Open Date: &lt;/strong&gt;11/10/26&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anticipated Posting Close Date*: &lt;/strong&gt;1/1/26&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Job posting may close early due to the volume of applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Accounting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Fastly’s Accounting team is looking for an impact-driven Senior Manager, Accounting with a strong public company background to help shape how we close, consolidate, and scale our Controllership organization. Reporting to the Assistant Corporate Controller, you will lead and mentor a high-performing team responsible for orchestrating the consolidated US GAAP month-end close and overseeing critical operational accounting areas—including operating expenses, sales commissions, cash and investments, and network infrastructure assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact role for an experienced accounting leader who pairs deep technical and operational acumen with the ability to translate complex financial data into actionable business insights. The ideal candidate leads with strong operational instincts and brings a proven track record in close orchestration, team mentorship, workflow automation, and cross-functional partnership across a global organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Team Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a team of accounting professionals, setting clear operational priorities, balancing close workloads, and fostering professional growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Direct the end-to-end monthly and quarterly close cadence for Fastly’s primary consolidated US GAAP reporting—governing the close calendar, checklists, recurring allocations, journal entry workflows in compliance with SOX and internal accounting policies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network Infrastructure &amp;amp; Fixed Assets Governance: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide strategic oversight for global network hardware and capital assets—to govern capitalization thresholds, multi-location CIP-to-in-service timing, and ASC 360 impairment/disposal evaluations alongside our Global Network Infrastructure and FP&amp;amp;A leaders.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating Expenses &amp;amp; FP&amp;amp;A Alignment: &lt;/strong&gt;Direct end-to-end OpEx accounting workflows—partnering closely with FP&amp;amp;A and business leaders to evaluate spend trends, validate complex vendor accruals, anticipate variance drivers, and deliver complete, accurate monthly reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commissions Accounting: &lt;/strong&gt;Supervise the accounting, policy application, and monthly amortization models for deferred contract acquisition costs in close coordination with the Commissions team and FP&amp;amp;A.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cash, Investments &amp;amp; Treasury Accounting: &lt;/strong&gt;Direct timely and accurate domestic and global operating cash reconciliations and corporate investment portfolio accounting (ASC 320 / ASC 820), verifying valuation accuracy, interest accruals, and balance sheet classifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance Sheet Governance &amp;amp; Executive Flux Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Safeguard general ledger integrity and chart of accounts hygiene; review complex reconciliations and deliver executive-ready balance sheet and P&amp;amp;L flux commentaries that effectively articulate core business drivers to leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a trusted advisor to Global Network Infrastructure, FP&amp;amp;A and other business leaders—aligning emerging commercial initiatives with US GAAP standards and supporting key strategic financial decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit Readiness &amp;amp; SOX Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead coordination with internal and external audit teams, maintaining an audit-ready posture, championing internal control design, and ensuring timely resolution of technical inquiries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Systems Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion close acceleration and scalability by identifying automation opportunities, refining NetSuite workflows, and adopting modern controllership tools to eliminate manual spreadsheet dependencies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8–10+ years of progressive accounting experience in public accounting and/or high-growth public technology companies, including 3+ years of direct people management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Credentials:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field; active CPA license preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close Leadership &amp;amp; Systems Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience managing complex multi-entity closes and workflow automation within NetSuite ERP (or equivalent tier-one ERP systems).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated track record building collaborative, high-trust partnerships with Supply Chain, Infrastructure Engineering, FP&amp;amp;A, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep working knowledge of US GAAP and SOX internal controls, with demonstrated strength across ASC 340-40, ASC 360, ASC 320/820, and operational expense accrual governance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional ability to synthesize complex accounting matters, variance analyses, and operational trade-offs into crisp, decision-ready insights for senior leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Scaling Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; A proactive builder who thrives in dynamic environments, with a passion for designing scalable processes and mentoring team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’ll be super impressed if you have experience in any of these:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Practical experience identifying and deploying automated workflows or AI tools that have accelerated close velocity and eliminated manual review.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Hands-on leadership overseeing high-volume network infrastructure and hardware assets using NetSuite’s Fixed Assets Management (FAM) module.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience in a fast-paced, high-growth technology company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
