&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager - Pricing &amp;amp; Packaging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a detailed-oriented and motivated individual to join the Pricing &amp;amp; Packaging team. You are a strategic problem solver, thrive at building monetization strategies and enjoy a fast-paced &amp;amp; high-growth environment. Your role will be pivotal in driving long-term growth by executing pricing, packaging, and monetization initiatives across Fastly’s product portfolio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner closely with the product team &lt;/strong&gt;to build and define strategies and product roadmap&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead pricing &amp;amp; packaging programs &lt;/strong&gt;to increase revenue and growth, capitalize on strengths and mitigate challenges for products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end commercialization and operationalization &lt;/strong&gt;delivering programs from concept to launch partnering with Sales and Marketing, Legal, Finance, Business systems and others, owning every step along the way driving consensus cross-functionally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Conduct qualitative and quantitative research to test strategy hypotheses, review and analyze pricing trends and discounting, validate customer&#39;s willingness to pay and product positioning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Research buyer motivations, analyze performance data and market trends to drive frequent iteration of pricing for Fastly&#39;s products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Provide expertise to teams on &lt;strong&gt;pricing metrics, pricing &amp;amp; packaging strategies and frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;. Ensure consistency across the entire product portfolio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;7-10 total years’ work experience in product management, pricing &amp;amp; packaging, management consulting or strategic finance field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong experience executing on monetization strategies for B2B, SaaS and usage-based companies in related industries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Excellent quantitative and data analytical skills. High proficiency in Excel, Looker, Salesforce or other business applications to gather data, structure and analyze into actionable pricing strategies and business insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Ability to thrive and form well-reasoned opinions from multiple perspectives and limited information&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Customer focused, seeking a deep understanding of target users and are adept at understanding their problems and arriving at elegant solutions to those problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Self directed, highly motivated and intellectually curious to tackle complex challenges and deliver discernible impact on the business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Great presentation, communication and influence skills that tell a cohesive story and drive consensus to decision making&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
