&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Infrastructure-as-code experience (e.g., Terraform, Ansible)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
