&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in the protocols and practices that make up the fabric of the global internet, including TCP/IP, BGP, Anycast and DNS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in Automation and coding using languages like Python, or similar.&lt;/p&gt;
