&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;There is a strong preference for Hybrid near a local office.&amp;nbsp; However, we may be willing to consider remote candidates within the US.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
