&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fastly helps people stay better connected with the things they love. Fastly’s edge cloud platform enables customers to create great digital experiences quickly, securely, and reliably by processing, serving, and securing our customers’ applications as close to their end-users as possible — at the edge of the Internet. The platform is designed to take advantage of the modern internet, to be programmable, and to support agile software development. Fastly’s customers include many of the world’s most prominent companies, including GitHub, Yelp, Paramount, and JetBlue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building a more trustworthy Internet. Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posting Open Date: &lt;/strong&gt;November 12, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anticipated Posting Close Date*:&lt;/strong&gt; December 12, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Job posting may close early due to the volume of applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Technical Marketing Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Fastly is seeking a deeply technical, compellingly articulate, and passionately instructive Staff Technical Marketing Engineer to champion our products. Whether you&#39;re a seasoned technical Sales Engineer with a gift for teaching, a hands-on Technical Marketer who crafts brilliant demos, or a Solutions Architect eager to evangelize cutting-edge security, if you thrive on building demos and making complex technology understandable and impactful, we are excited to connect with you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;As Fastly’s Staff Technical Marketing Engineer, you will be instrumental in showcasing the power of our security solutions. Your drive to create compelling technical narratives, impactful demonstrations, and empowering educational resources will be crucial. You will partner extensively with Product, Engineering, Sales, and Marketing and Analyst Relations to equip our teams and customers with the knowledge and tools to leverage Fastly&#39;s security prowess.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Design, build, script, and record impactful technical demonstrations, deep dive presentations, technical “how to” guides, hands-on labs, demo environments, technical blogs, technical videos, and best practices focused on Fastly products in order to increase field confidence, accelerate sales cycles, and improve technical win rates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Own and manage your own demo environments/tenants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Use technical tools, scripts, or APIs to demonstrate how to solve technical problems or showcase product capabilities. Document and communicate such solutions to the broader organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Lead engaging live and recorded technical training sessions for technical field roles, covering new products, new features, security concepts, and industry positioning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Maintain technical knowledge of competitors and contribute to technical battlecards and objection handling guides&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Be the go-to technical resource and subject matter expert for technical field roles, assisting with questions and strategic opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Product Management, Product Marketing, and Sales to share feedback and insights from the field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Sales Engineering and Technical Enablement to integrate your technical content into cohesive enablement programs and demo environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Continuously learn about Fastly products, security, the industry landscape, and other relevant technologies to maintain and share your expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development of the technical marketing strategy for Fastly&#39;s security products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Represent the company to industry analysts and at industry and customer events (virtual and in-person). This role will require travel up to 25% of the time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Own all aspects of competitive intelligence / competitive testing and benchmarking for security products&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You are a deeply technical professional with 5-8 years of experience in roles like Sales Engineering, Technical Marketing, Solutions Architecture, Technical Evangelism, or Technical Training in disciplines like Application Security, Content Delivery, or Compute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You have strong hands-on expertise in application security, API security, L3-L7 firewalls, DDoS/IDS solutions - with a keen understanding of platform engineering, and/or modern software delivery&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You have a proven ability and genuine passion for teaching, mentoring, and enabling others. You are capable of explaining complex technical concepts clearly and concisely.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You excel at creating technical content including demos, presentations, labs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You have excellent verbal, written, and presentation skills. You are comfortable engaging with technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You write your own scripts to demonstrate product capabilities and are at ease using APIs and Infrastructure-as-Code tools such as Terraform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;You possess strong organizational and project management skills, with an ability to manage multiple concurrent projects and prioritize effectively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’ll be super impressed if you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Advanced subject matter expertise in application security (L7 DDoS/ AppSec, API Security, WAF)&amp;nbsp; &lt;u&gt;and&lt;/u&gt; networks security (L3/L4 DDoS, Firewall)&lt;br&gt;An impactful portfolio of innovative technical marketing content (e.g., viral technical blogs, open-source tools, interactive experiences) with proven community or sales results&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Pivotal experience defining the function, strategy, and deliverables as a founding or early Technical Marketing Engineer for a security product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to create and tailor technical content and training programs for diverse global audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Expertise in crafting compelling narratives and demos for integrated multi-product security solutions that showcase holistic value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;A track record of developing internal tools or resources that demonstrably enhanced field team efficiency, technical depth, or demo capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
