&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency across web/app security, CDN, networking, cloud infrastructure or related technologies, with the ability to translate technical capabilities into business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to coordinate cross‑functional teams and manage complex, multi‑threaded programs to successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional customer‑facing, presentation and project management skills; high attention to detail and ability to prioritize in a fast‑moving, multitasking environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self‑starter, independent, disciplined, highly organized, with excellent verbal and written communication in English (local language skills a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
