&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Python or Bash for log parsing and workflow automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with Infrastructure as Code/Security as Code(SaC) (Terraform) or edge-based configurations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
